ocalhost:5173/services/app-marketing)**\n- 👉 **[BI Analytics, GA4 & MarTech](http://localhost:5173/services/analytics)**\n\n**Har Service Page me include h\n<truncated 858 bytes>\n/work/edvance-academy-edtech)**\n  - 👉 **[MediHealth Super Specialty (+280% Bookings)](http://localhost:5173/work/medihealth-super-specialty)**\n\n---\n\n#### 4. 🏢 About Us Page (`/about`):\n- 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/about](http://localhost:5173/about)**\n- Agency Story & 20+ Years Heritage\n- 4 Operating Principles (*Commercial First, Creative with a Job, One Joined-Up Team, Extreme Velocity*)\n- Awards & Recognition Showcase\n- Nationwide Office Hubs\n\n---\n\n#### 5. 💼 Careers & Culture Hub (`/careers`):\n- 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/careers](http://localhost:5173/careers)**\n- Agency Culture & Perks (*Remote-first / Hybrid, Learning Stipend, Performance Bonuses*)\n- Active Job Openings Grid\n- **Interactive 1-Click Job Application Modal**: Candidates directly portfolio & contact submit kar sakte hain (ye lead turant Admin Applications CRM me save ho jati hai!).\n\n---\n\n#### 6. 📚 Growth Playbooks & SEO Insights (`/blog`):\n- 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/blog](http://localhost:5173/blog)**\n- Interactive Social Sharing (*LinkedIn, WhatsApp, Twitter, Copy Link*)\n- Real-Time Likes System\n- Live Comments Stream\n- Curated Recent Articles Sidebar\n\n---\n\n#### 7. 🎯 Consultation & Free Audit (`/contact`):\n- 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/contact](http://localhost:5173/contact)**\n- Full 360° Growth Audit Proposal Funnel\n- Direct Strategy Hotline & Regional Office Details\n\n---\n\n#### 8. ⚡ Admin Studio CMS (`/admin`):\n- 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/admin](http://localhost:5173/admin)** *(Access Key: `dev-admin-token`)*\n- Standalone layout with dark sidebar and clean SaaS database rows\n- Two-Column Studio Editor with inspector sidebar, Google SERP Snippet Preview, Image selector/presets, and 1-Click AI Copywriting Assistants\n- **Instant 2-Way Real-Time Sync**: Kisi bhi content ko edit k