{"step_index":471,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:54:11Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-22T17:24:11+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-22T17:24:16+05:30\nThe search for \"\"techmagnate.com\" font family CSS typography colors\" returned the following summary:\nTo determine the specific CSS typography and color values for **Techmagnate.com**, you can inspect the site's live styles using your browser's Developer Tools (typically accessed by right-clicking any element and selecting **\"Inspect\"**).\n\nWhile specific CSS values can change during website updates, here is a breakdown of how to identify and apply these design elements:\n\n### 1. Identifying Font Family (CSS)\nTechmagnate uses a modern, professional aesthetic typical of leading digital marketing agencies. To find the exact font family:\n*   **Inspect the element:** Right-click on any heading or body text on the website and select **Inspect**.\n*   **Check the 'Styles' pane:** Look for the `font-family` property under the CSS rules. \n*   **Common Industry Standards:** Agencies in this sector frequently use clean, sans-serif fonts such as **Roboto, Open Sans, Montserrat, or Poppins**[1][2]. These fonts are preferred for their high readability and modern \"tech\" appearance[3][1].\n\n### 2. Identifying Colors\nThe Techmagnate brand identity is centered around professional, trustworthy, and energetic tones[4].\n*   **Use Browser DevTools:** In the \"Elements\" tab of your inspector, look for `color` or `background-color` properties. You can click on the color swatch next to the hex code (e.g., `#FFFFFF`) to open the color picker and see the exact shade.\n*   **Color Themes:** Tech brands often utilize a combination of \"Trust Blue\" (to evoke reliability) and vibrant accent colors (to highlight \"Call to Action\" buttons)[5][6]. \n\n### How to extract these details yourself:\n1.  **Open the Website:** Go to [Techmagnate.com](https://www.techmagnate.com).\n2.  **Access D