{"step_index":491,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:55:46Z","content":"Aapki website ki typography, styling aur color scheme ko **Techmagnate.com ke exact live source code ke sath SAME TO SAME match** kar diya gaya hai! 🎯✨\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Techmagnate.com Exact Typography & Visual Overhaul:\n\n#### 1. 🔤 Exact Font Family (`DM Sans` & `Plus Jakarta Sans`):\n- **Body & Paragraphs**: `DM Sans` (Techmagnate ka exact Google font).\n- **Headings & Titles**: `Plus Jakarta Sans` & `DM Sans` (`font-weight: 700 / 800`, modern, sharp, clean tech sans-serif).\n- **Zero Serif**: Purane serif fonts (`Playfair Display`) ko completely remove kar diya gaya hai — ab har ek heading aur text **100% clean, crisp aur modern enterprise tech style** me dikhta hai.\n\n#### 2. 🎯 Exact Techmagnate Brand Color System:\n- **Corporate Trust Navy**: `#0a2540` / `#06192e` (Deep Tech Navy)\n- **Signature CTA Orange**: `#f15b29` (Techmagnate ka signature sunset orange CTA button)\n- **Corporate Accent Blue**: `#0868a0`\n- **Metric Green**: `#16a34a`\n- **Clean Slate Backgrounds**: Pure White `#ffffff` aur Soft Slate Gray `#f8fafc`\n- **High-Contrast Text**: `#0f172a` (Headings) aur `#475569` (Body text)\n\n#### 3. ⚡ Core UI Sections:\n- **Top Bar**: Deep Navy `#06192e` with orange badge & direct phone hotline.\n- **Sticky Navbar**: Pure White with deep navy text, orange monogram `GF`, and orange CTA `Claim Free 360° Audit →`.\n- **Hero Section**: Deep Navy gradient `#0a2540` with bold modern sans-serif headline, 60-Second Instant Audit Box in clean white card with sharp orange button, and trust badges strip.\n- **Client Logos**: Clean cards with verified growth metrics (`+2,260% Leads`, `4.8x ROAS`).\n- **360° Services Grid**: Clean SaaS cards with soft hover elevation and orange icon boxes.\n- **Digital Report Card**: Deep Navy card with bold orange/green metric callouts.\n- **All Sub-Pages**: `/services`, `/work`, `/about`, `/careers`, `/blog`, aur `/contact` sabhi **`DM Sans`** typography me perfectly styled hain!\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Abhi Live Preview Dekhein:\n\n👉 **[http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)**\n\nAap browser me [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173) open karke exact Techmagnate style typography aur visuals check kar sakte hain!"}
